&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in MIS, CS, Finance or other technical/ analytical fields.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum 4+ years of relevant business experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic SQL, Python, JavaScript and HTML required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic understanding of UI/UX tools and Flowchart tools (ie. Figma/Lucidchart)&lt;/li&gt;
