&lt;p&gt;This is a high-visibility, co-selling, and partner-hunting role tasked with building out our NSW partner ecosystem to drive exponential growth. You will take end-to-end ownership of regional channel strategy, actively activating tier-1 Systems Integrators (SIs), top IT VARs, and regional distributors to generate net-new, partner-sourced enterprise deal registrations while displacing legacy, entrenched hardware incumbents.&lt;/p&gt;
