&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;J.D. degree from an ABA-approved law school or equivalent&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Member of at least one state Bar Association in good standing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of dedicated corporate legal experience, combining both in-house and law firm experience (preferably with at least 4 years of in-house experience at a fast growing tech company)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct, hands-on experience taking a technology company through an IPO process and managing post-IPO public company compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven track record of independently leading complex corporate transactions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong collaborative capability with executive stakeholders, with a business-forward approach to navigating complex regulatory environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building, leading, and managing a team of legal professionals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent legal and business judgment with the ability to provide practical, concise advice&lt;/li&gt;
