&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an Engineering Manager to lead a new team focused on building AI agents that improve engineering velocity, reliability, and developer experience across the company.&lt;br&gt;This team will operate with a 0→1 charter inside our Infrastructure / DevX organization, developing agentic systems that automate workflows such as CI failure triage, autonomous deployments, incident response, and proactive bug detection. The work will have a broad impact across all engineering teams by reducing toil and enabling faster iteration.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is both strategic and hands-on: you will define the roadmap, build and grow the team, and actively contribute to prototyping and development.&lt;/p&gt;
