&lt;li&gt;Build and lead a small, high-impact team of engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute hands-on to prototyping, coding, and unblocking technical challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish evaluation frameworks for agent performance (golden tasks, regression sets, replay, LLM-as-judge)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Infrastructure, Security, and DevX teams to integrate agents into core workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive high engineering standards through design docs, RFCs, and strong execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
