&lt;h3&gt;About the Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Verkada is looking for a talented and ambitious Enterprise Account Executive to grow our Enterprise footprint across Victoria. This is a hunting-focused role, giving you the opportunity to shape and own your territory from the ground up while driving new business for one of the fastest-growing technology companies in the world.&lt;/p&gt;
