&lt;p&gt;This is a remote positioned based in Victoria, with a preference for candidates located in Melbourne, and requires regular travel for customer meetings, site visits, and partner engagements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the full sales cycle from prospecting to close: generate leads, run online demos, craft proposals, and close deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and execute a territory plan, including research, lead generation, and account prioritisation.&lt;/li&gt;
