&lt;li&gt;Multithread accounts, engaging stakeholders at all levels to secure and expand relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a deep understanding of Verkada’s product suite and how it fits within the broader physical security ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a trusted advisor to enterprise customers, helping them modernise their security infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Solutions Engineers to deliver tailored demos and ensure smooth product rollouts.&lt;/li&gt;
