&lt;li&gt;This role requires regular travel, estimated to be 40% of the time, including both domestic and international destinations as needed. The successful candidate must be comfortable with frequent travel to support business operations, customer and partner engagements and team collaboration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
