&lt;li&gt;Build high-performance features across Verkada’s embedded Linux device ecosystem (Cameras, Access Control, Alarms, and Environmental Sensors) prioritizing seamless user experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extend core backend services implemented in Go and Python.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve and maintain internal developer tools and infrastructure to streamline product delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
