&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Lead Product Manager to own Verkada&#39;s Trailer Product Line. Your mission is to make turn-key edge deployments as reliable and easy to manage as anything inside the building.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are committed to a thriving in-office culture. This role requires you to work onsite at our HQ in San Mateo, CA.&lt;/p&gt;
