&lt;li&gt;Deliver the trailer platform&#39;s core promise: continuous off-grid uptime with zero site infrastructure. Push solar, battery, and cellular intelligence until the trailer runs itself, then expand into new form factors and use cases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the commercial model for the trailer business: pricing and packaging, hardware-plus-license economics, data plans, and new acquisition options such as financing, leasing, or trailer-as-a-service&lt;/li&gt;
