&lt;li&gt;Take projects from inception through deployment to customer support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the manufacturing process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience working with embedded Linux&lt;/li&gt;
