&lt;p&gt;This is a high-impact role designed for a builder who wants to accelerate their career in the People space. You will partner directly with our People Partners to drive performance management, employee engagement, and data analytics. If you are passionate about maximizing the employee experience, solving complex problems at scale, and want to grow alongside a rapidly scaling tech organization, this is your launchpad.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are committed to a thriving in-office culture. This role requires that you be on-site at our office in San Mateo, CA 5 days a week.&lt;/p&gt;
