&lt;p&gt;Do you have physical security experience and a knack for creative problem-solving and a desire to make an impact? If so, this role is for you. We are seeking a sharp and driven physical security professional to join Verkada&#39;s lean but mean Global Security Team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role would entail developing, implementing, and overseeing security programs for company-related events, ranging from smaller field events to large company and third-party conferences. In this role, you&#39;ll partner closely with the marketing and events team to translate event plans into appropriate security requirements, and attend events to ensure plans are implemented. You&#39;ll also work within the protective services team in our global security function outside the event calendar, driving insider threat and threat intelligence programs as well as supporting executive protection. This role is a mix of proactive planning and on-the-ground execution, and suits someone who&#39;s equally comfortable building a security plan from scratch, stepping in to run daily operations, and traveling to supervise event security.&amp;nbsp; If you enjoy building from the ground up, this role is for you!&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;While Verkada HQ is located in San Mateo,CA we are open to both in-office or remote candidates and candidate must be willing to travel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
