&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;As a Product Design Mechanical Engineer at Verkada, you’ll play a key role in designing and bringing to market our next generation of enterprise intercom products, owning the mechanical design from early concept through mass production.&lt;/div&gt;
