&lt;li&gt;Passion for designing aesthetically pleasing but easy to use hardware&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;End-to-end product development experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5 years of experience in mechanical design, manufacturing and electro-mechanical systems and products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel internationally up to 15%&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
