&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Regional Sales Manager (DACH) is responsible for hiring, managing and mentoring a team of Mid-Market level talent to meet and exceed their sales revenue goals. The Mid-Market team focuses on accounts with full-time employee counts of up to 2,000 employees within the DACH region. Our Account Executives are responsible for maintaining high activity standards; daily prospecting, pipeline growth, prospect qualification, and delivering assigned monthly and quarterly sales revenue targets.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead a team of 7-8 direct reports covering DACH region&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, coach, train, and motivate direct reports through pipeline reviews, managing daily and weekly activities, forecasts and closed deals to ensure achievement of individual and team quotas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with your team to achieve both revenue and new logo targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learn &amp;amp; demonstrate the ability to showcase the Verkada platform across all product lines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work cross-functionally to align prioritisation &amp;amp; resources amongst channel, sales, product, marketing, recruiting, engineering, and operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work in a fast-paced environment, pivot as needed and adapt quickly to change, as well as be an influencing factor to the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic problem solving, project management, proactively addressing problems and surfacing scalable solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accurately forecast to sales leadership on a weekly, monthly, and quarterly basis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hire, develop, and lead a world-class team to support revenue targets for your team and the company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
