&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a brilliant, highly curious &lt;strong&gt;Customer Experience Researcher&lt;/strong&gt; who moves at startup speed to join our Design team and help us scale our customer research footprint across our physical security and smart hardware product lines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a true &quot;full-stack&quot; role: you own the research operations as much as the insights. We need a high-aptitude researcher who will hustle to build their own network of customers, run their own recruiting pipelines, and get out into the field to have deep, strategic conversations. You will engage with everyone from the C-suite executives using our software to the partners mounting our hardware.&lt;/p&gt;
