&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the Ops (Recruiting &amp;amp; Network Building):&lt;/strong&gt; You won&#39;t wait for participants to come to you. You will actively source, screen, and schedule your own panels. You&#39;ll build and nurture an ongoing network of VPs, partners, and installers to ensure a constant pipeline of strategic feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Move at Verkada Speed:&lt;/strong&gt; Conduct rapid, tactical research—contextual inquiries, prototype evaluations, and mockup reviews—that directly impacts product decisions before features ship.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engage with Executives:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead strategic research conversations with our B2B customers. You will regularly interact with IT Directors, VPs, and C-Suite executives to understand their high-level operational needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the Field (Travel):&lt;/strong&gt; Travel approximately once a month to conduct on-site contextual inquiries. You’ll observe the physical realities of our partners and installers, learning exactly what they need to deploy our hardware successfully in the real world.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bridge Hardware &amp;amp; Software:&lt;/strong&gt; Research the complete user journey, understanding how different users spend their time in the Verkada Command software platform, and how that connects to the physical installation of our devices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
