&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High Aptitude &amp;amp; Curiosity:&lt;/strong&gt; A couple of years of UX/Product research experience is preferred, immense curiosity, and a growth mindset matter just as much. We want someone eager to adapt to our fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Hustle:&lt;/strong&gt; You are comfortable rolling up your sleeves to handle the logistics of research—from writing screeners to target customers and managing outreach and scheduling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Presence:&lt;/strong&gt; You are highly articulate, confident, and comfortable commanding a room or leading a Zoom call with enterprise decision-makers and executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; You thrive on human connection. You prefer deep, qualitative interviews over monitoring anonymous usability metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
