&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be bilingual - fluent or native in Spanish and English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3-5 years of successful full-cycle recruiting experience: from source to close. Agency or internal experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must have Sales recruiting experience, GTM recruiting experience a plus.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ability to influence using collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
