&lt;p&gt;Verkada is transforming how organizations protect their people and places with an integrated, privacy-sensitive AI-powered platform that includes solutions for video security, access control, air quality sensors, alarms, intercoms, and visitor management.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’ve got serious momentum in the market: more than 30,000 customers (including 100+ of the Fortune 500), &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cnbc.com/2025/12/03/verkada-capitalg-valuation-security.html&quot;&gt;a $5.8B valuation&lt;/a&gt;, more than $1 billion in annualized bookings, and backing from CapitalG, Sequoia Capital, General Catalyst, Felicis Ventures, Next47 and more. Physical AI is one of the most consequential technology shifts of our time, and Verkada is at the center of it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You can look at all kinds of communities to see our platform’s impact in the world. It&#39;s the retailer that uses our agentic AI to deter theft before it happens. The warehouse that uses AI-powered alerts to make sure its team is protected on the floor with proper PPE. The school that’s alerted to a threat in real-time and triggers a lockdown in seconds, not minutes. We’re rapidly scaling this impact: today, more than 2 million Verkada devices are deployed across 170+ countries.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;About the Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_5250786b0e4fc80e-51&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;1,0&quot;&gt;We are looking for a highly motivated, hands-on, and collaborative Senior Accountant to help drive financial accounting quality and efficiency in a high-growth environment. Reporting to the Sr. Director of Accounting, you will be responsible for a variety of financial close and reporting activities, while also playing a role in overseeing our inventory tracking.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot;&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,0,0,0&quot;&gt;Perform monthly close activities, including preparing and recording journal entries, general ledger reconciliations, and variance analysis.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1,0,0&quot;&gt;Ensure accuracy and adherence to US GAAP and company policies for all assigned accounting areas and monthly close activities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,2,0,0&quot;&gt;Lead inventory accounting initiatives, including perpetual-to-general-ledger reconciliations, calculating Cost of Goods Sold (COGS), landed costs, and resolving standard cost variances.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,3,0,0&quot;&gt;Partner closely with Operations and Supply Chain to coordinate periodic physical inventory counts and cycle count programs across internal warehouses and 3PL locations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,4,0,0&quot;&gt;Prepare periodic and ad hoc financial reporting, conduct financial analysis, and explain trends or relationships on the financial statements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,5,0,0&quot;&gt;Ensure compliance with SOX 404 key controls, analyze reserves (such as E&amp;amp;O), and assist with internal and external audit requests.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,6,0,0&quot;&gt;Support cross-functional initiatives by providing accounting insights, troubleshooting operational issues, and contributing to process improvements that optimize month-end close efficiency.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
