&lt;li&gt;Experience driving technical direction and leading engineers on project execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect scalable systems and design latency sensitive applications for our Intercoms deployed around the world.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience collaborating cross functionally to design complex systems with simple and robust backend APIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;History of shipping out significant products. We are looking for someone who can own backend systems end-to-end.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
