&lt;li&gt;Bachelors or Masters in Computer Science, Electrical Engineering or closely related degree or equivalent experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of work experience in an embedded engineering role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in C, C++&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
