&lt;p&gt;You can look at all kinds of communities to see our platform’s impact in the world. It&#39;s the retailer that uses our agentic AI to deter theft before it happens. The warehouse that uses AI-powered alerts to make sure its team is protected on the floor with proper PPE. The school that’s alerted to a threat in real-time and triggers a lockdown in seconds, not minutes. We’re rapidly scaling this impact: today, more than 2 million Verkada devices are deployed across 170+ countries.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Verkada, we&#39;re known for pushing traditional boundaries, and our B2B marketing efforts are no exception. Our New Products team owns go-to-market strategy for each new product line until it &quot;graduates&quot; by reaching $100M+ in annual sales. It&#39;s the most impactful segment in marketing and will shape Verkada&#39;s long-term growth as a multi-product company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About This Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Growth Manager, New Products, you&#39;ll craft the go-to-market strategy and growth-hack campaigns that drive revenue for a new product line. You&#39;ll have full ownership: you&#39;ll identify the key growth levers for your product, zero in on a growth strategy, and drive the campaigns that execute it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In many ways, you&#39;ll be building a startup within a startup. You&#39;ll design and run innovative experiments and campaigns, with dedicated sales and engineering resources to help scale your strategy and your product&#39;s growth. Once your product reaches $100M in annual bookings, it graduates from New Products into a fully operationalized business unit built on the foundation you established, and you move on to the next product!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for someone with the skills and experience to contribute to pipeline generation for our new product lines from day one, while growing into a cross-functional leader at the company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Founder-like ownership of all things Go-To-Market for your product with a heavy emphasis on marketing. Consider yourself the product’s CMO, responsible for unlocking and driving your new product’s growth.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work alongside the CMO, Growth Marketing,Product Marketing, Product Management and Sales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute new out-of-the-box experiments to deliver, target, and run marketing campaigns that drive direct revenue impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conceptualize and test new experimental campaigns that can help drive revenue at higher efficiency as we scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage with a fast-growing sales team to ensure your growth efforts convert into real opportunities down the funnel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze and optimize on lower-funnel metrics to ensure campaign ROI improves as it scales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product Management to drive growth strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This is an entrepreneurial role – perfect for former or aspiring founders. You’ll have the unique opportunity to build out and own a new product’s business operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of work experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor degree&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong quantitative ability and analytical skills (including experience with SQL and Excel)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A hacker’s type mentality full of curiosity and creativity (obsessed with solving problems and never gives up)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong project management and organization skills with attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ability to work cross-functionally to prioritize multiple initiatives with various stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ambitious and driven to be a top performer within the company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Roll up your sleeves type mentality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preferred candidates may have been:&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ex-Founders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Former big tech product leaders looking to dive deeper into growth marketing and drive greater impact at much faster speed;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Early startup employees&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
