&lt;li&gt;Technical knowledge of audio processing and acoustics, such as audio DSPs, microphone selection and design, beamforming and noise cancellation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of improving reliability and quality with data: you&#39;ve defined quality metrics, built the dashboards and moved the numbers&lt;/li&gt;
