&lt;li&gt;Strong proficiency with scripting and programming, especially using Python for automations in AWS Lambda or Google Cloud Functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience developing integrations and automations with tools such as Workato or other enterprise-grade automation platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid familiarity with cloud infrastructure (AWS, Google Cloud, or Azure), including networking fundamentals, security best practices, and infrastructure-as-code (IaC) methodologies.&lt;/li&gt;
