&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of backend development experience in Go or Python.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years experience designing and building large-scale, resilient distributed systems using service-oriented or microservice architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years experience with cloud infrastructure, containerization, and deployment automation (AWS, Docker, Kubernetes, or similar).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years experience with databases, queues, blob storage, and distributed systems fundamentals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You bring a systems design mindset, able to simplify complex workflows and deliver scalable, efficient solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You care deeply about performance, reliability, and security, and have a track record of building services that excel in all three.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You thrive in a fast-paced environment, demonstrate creativity and sound judgment, and take ownership of problems end to end.&lt;/li&gt;
