&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 4+ years in Data Operations, Supply Chain Analytics, Analytics Engineering, or Business Intelligence. Direct supply chain/manufacturing data experience preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Systems &amp;amp; Domain Knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience with ERPs (NetSuite), supply chain planning platforms, and warehouse management systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Toolkit:&lt;/strong&gt; Advanced SQL (BigQuery, Snowflake), experience with cloud data warehouses, and comfort building automation in Google Apps Script, Python, or similar scripting tools. Familiarity with Excel/Google Sheets modeling required.&lt;/li&gt;
