&lt;li&gt;“A benefit of being a TSE at Verkada is about being a part of a fast-growing company. You learn about the latest products deeply and learn how to effectively communicate what you have learned in an easy-to-understand way for customers: ‘If you can&#39;t explain it simply, you don&#39;t understand it well enough.’ Albert Einstein” - &lt;em&gt;Daniel, TSE Intern, London&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
