&lt;li&gt;Provide training, coaching, and feedback to ensure Technical Support Engineers master the Verkada portfolio and resolve customer issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the team: Hire, mentor, and grow a strong bench of networking, systems, and security experts who deliver high-touch customer service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and define metrics: Measure team performance to ensure we deliver on our high expectations of technical support. Build and refine processes to monitor and drive continuous improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer management: Be the authoritative voice of Verkada Support when speaking with customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-functionally partner with Engineering and Product to solve issues and share structured customer insights and feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
