&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruiting Operations:&lt;/strong&gt; Manage comprehensive university program logistics, streamline recruiting workflows, scale the intern experience, and oversee end-to-end branding initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Program Administration:&lt;/strong&gt; Assist sales leadership with the onboarding and offboarding of program participants, tracking completion metrics, and maintaining meticulous participant records.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership Support:&lt;/strong&gt; Proactively manage program calendars, prioritize team tasks to align with leadership goals, and assist with formal program reporting and documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; Ensure all recruiting and onboarding processes are executed accurately and efficiently, maintaining high standards of data integrity and professional delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 4+ years of professional experience in program management, program administration, or early career/university recruiting within a high-growth environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Administrative Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven experience in coordinating early career programs within a fast-paced corporate environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Organizational Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Superior organizational abilities with a natural talent for structuring complex timelines and managing multiple administrative priorities simultaneously.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Effective Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptional interpersonal skills; ability to connect with students, external vendors, and C-level leadership alike.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Attention to Detail:&lt;/strong&gt; Meticulous attention to detail and a commitment to accuracy in data entry, record-keeping, and logistical execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project &amp;amp; Event Management:&lt;/strong&gt; A proven track record of managing logistically complex projects and large-scale events from conception to completion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The &#39;Grit&#39; Factor:&lt;/strong&gt; Resilience, high energy, and a hands-on approach—equally comfortable packing swag boxes as you are presenting program strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Proficiency:&lt;/strong&gt; Advanced proficiency in Google Workspace (Docs, Sheets, Slides, Calendar) and experience with recruiting platforms or CRM tools. Bonus: Experience with Handshake or other early career recruiting tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
