&lt;p data-start=&quot;351&quot; data-end=&quot;432&quot;&gt;This opportunity is &lt;strong data-start=&quot;371&quot; data-end=&quot;429&quot;&gt;only for current or former collegiate student-athletes&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;687&quot; data-end=&quot;1141&quot;&gt;We’re looking for student-athletes to join our &lt;strong data-start=&quot;734&quot; data-end=&quot;763&quot;&gt;Sales Development Program&lt;/strong&gt;, where you&#39;ll gain the skills to kickstart a long-term career in tech sales. Many of our top performers—and even our &lt;strong data-start=&quot;881&quot; data-end=&quot;908&quot;&gt;VP of Sales Development&lt;/strong&gt;—come from collegiate sports backgrounds. We&#39;ve built a team that thrives on competition, teamwork, and grit, and this program is designed to help athletes like you make a strong transition from the field to a fast-paced sales floor.&lt;/p&gt;
